1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,945
Broadway Financial's third quarter:
fast growth, thin profits.

2
00:00:05,495 --> 00:00:10,530
Earnings were four cents a share, up
from two cents. No analyst estimate
was found.

3
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:16,158
Deposits rose thirty-one percent in a
year, to one point one one billion
dollars.

4
00:00:16,708 --> 00:00:20,108
But expenses took eighty cents of
every revenue dollar.

5
00:00:20,658 --> 00:00:24,816
And the two point six four percent
margin was the lowest of its peers.

6
00:00:25,366 --> 00:00:29,488
A smaller loan loss provision did most
of the work in the quarter's gain.

7
00:00:30,038 --> 00:00:36,956
Chief executive Brian Argrett says the
focus is on enhancing profitability.
That is the test for next quarter.

